What is Digital Construction Management?
Digital Construction Management integrates Building Information Modeling (BIM), Internet‑of‑Things (IoT) sensor feeds, cloud‑based collaboration suites, and AI‑driven analytics into a unified digital ecosystem. The solution set enables project owners, contractors, architects and engineers to monitor real‑time schedule performance, resource utilization, safety compliance, and sustainability metrics from a single data lake. By turning raw design data and field observations into actionable insights, the technology reduces rework, accelerates decision‑making, and improves overall project profitability.
